# WP21-PLAY (Far): editor Play expands every prefab instance as the cook does (ExpandPrefabInstances), so the
# instance WP21_Span (4 cubes 1500 cm apart) streams as 4 records in 4 cells and the saved HLODs stand in for
# each one. Compare with the Runtime frame of the cooked world (WP21 p10, frames/runtime/wp21_far.png).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP21_PrefabSpan_Far.desce
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда play_far 4 HLOD-замены кубов, без дыры на месте префаба, как кадр Runtime far; 0 ячеек загружено
Когда run Action "Stop"
